## 🔧 Commandes importantes apprises

### **Base Symfony**

```bash
symfony new . --webapp                    # Créer projet
symfony serve                            # Serveur dev
php bin/console --version                # Vérifier installation
```

### **Base de données**

```bash
php bin/console doctrine:database:create          # Créer BDD
php bin/console make:entity EntityName            # Créer entité
php bin/console make:migration                    # Générer migration
php bin/console doctrine:migrations:migrate       # Appliquer migrations
php bin/console doctrine:schema:validate          # Vérifier schéma
```

### **Packages**

```bash
composer require symfony/uid              # Installer UUID
composer show | grep uid                 # Vérifier installation
```

